<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, 12 March 1997 - Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,700.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	9.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.44 CHF		  GEARING	13.60 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   18.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,660.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
